<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Wrap and Wow 5 | Handmade Gifts</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Wrap and Wow 5 — handmade gifts, ribbon flowers, bouquets, hampers and personalised surprises.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      background: #faf6f1;
      color: #4d4039;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    header {
      background: #f4e5df;
      padding: 18px 7%;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ead5cc;
    }

    .nav {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #5a4840;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 22px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: #9b7568;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 82vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 7%;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(250,246,241,.82), rgba(250,246,241,.92)),
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, #ead7ce, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, #dfc9be, transparent 38%);
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 780px;
    }

    .small-title {
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #98766b;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 78px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: #493b35;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: auto;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #6c5b53;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 13px 27px;
      background: #806157;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: .2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #654d44;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    section {
      padding: 75px 7%;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 35px;
      color: #514039;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #806f67;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .products {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .product {
      background: #fffdfb;
      border: 1px solid #eaded7;
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: .25s;
    }

    .product:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(85,65,55,.09);
    }

    .product-image {
      height: 190px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #eee1da;
      color: #8b7064;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .product-info {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .product h3 {
      font-size: 21px;
      color: #4e4039;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .product p {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #75665f;
    }

    .price {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #76564b;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .custom {
      background: #f0e1db;
    }

    .custom-box {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
      border: 1px solid #e2cfc7;
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 45px 25px;
    }

    .custom-box h2 {
      font-size: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .custom-box p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #6b5a52;
    }

    .services {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .service {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 28px 20px;
      background: #fffdfb;
      border-radius: 17px;
      border: 1px solid #eaded7;
    }

    .service h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .service p {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #76665f;
    }

    .order {
      background: #faf1ec;
    }

    .order-box {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .order-box h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .order-box p {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #6e5d55;
    }

    .steps {
      margin: 28px auto;
      max-width: 500px;
      text-align: left;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .steps div {
      padding: 9px 0;
    }

    footer {
      background: #493d38;
      color: #eee5df;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 38px 7%;
    }

    footer h3 {
      font-size: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    footer p {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 5px 0;
      color: #d8ccc5;
    }

    .socials {
      margin-top: 18px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 18px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .socials a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      header {
        padding: 15px 5%;
      }

      .nav {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .nav-links {
        gap: 14px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 55px 5%;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 75vh;
        padding: 55px 6%;
      }

      .product-image {
        height: 170px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <a href="#home" class="logo">Wrap and Wow 5</a>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#products">Products</a>
        <a href="#custom">Custom</a>
        <a href="#order">Order</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="small-title">Handmade • Thoughtful • Wrapped with love</div>

        <h1>Wrap and Wow 5</h1>

        <p>
          Handmade gifts and little surprises, created with care
          for birthdays, celebrations and the people who mean the most.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="#products">Explore Collection</a>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section id="products">

      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Our Collection</h2>
        <p>Handmade pieces made to make someone's day a little more special.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="products">

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Ribbon Flowers & Bouquets</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Ribbon Flowers</h3>
            <p>Handmade ribbon flowers, bouquets and beautiful floral arrangements.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Ribbon Gajra</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Ribbon Gajra</h3>
            <p>Reusable handmade gajras created from satin ribbon.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Bracelets & Bands</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Bracelets</h3>
            <p>Simple handmade bracelets and bands for gifting or keeping.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Hairpins & Accessories</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Hair Accessories</h3>
            <p>Handmade hairpins and pretty little accessories.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Mini Gift Baskets</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Mini Baskets</h3>
            <p>Small personalised baskets filled with carefully selected gifts.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Surprise Gifts</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Surprise Gifts</h3>
            <p>Thoughtful little surprises prepared according to your occasion.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Glitter Flowers</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Glitter Flowers</h3>
            <p>Decorative handmade flowers for gifting and special occasions.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Bag & Bow Charms</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Bag Charms</h3>
            <p>Cute handmade charms and bows to add a personal touch.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Mini Sticker Packages</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Sticker Packs</h3>
            <p>Mini decorative sticker packages for journals, gifts and more.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Pearl Head Crown</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Pearl Head Crown</h3>
            <p>A delicate handmade pearl accessory for special occasions.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Chocolate Floral Cake</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Chocolate Floral Cake</h3>
            <p>A sweet handmade-style gifting arrangement combining chocolates and flowers.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Chocolate & Money Bouquet</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Chocolate + Money Bouquet</h3>
            <p>A personalised bouquet combining chocolates with currency notes.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Birthday Magazine</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Birthday Magazine</h3>
            <p>A personalised magazine-style birthday gift made especially for someone special.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product">
          <div class="product-image">Satin Ribbon Bag</div>
          <div class="product-info">
            <h3>Satin Ribbon Bag</h3>
            <p>A handmade crochet-style satin ribbon bag with a pearl handle.</p>
            <span class="price">Price depends on design</span>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="custom" id="custom">

      <div class="custom-box">
        <h2>Make It Yours</h2>

        <p>
          Want something different? We create customised gifts according
          to your preferred colours, quantity, occasion and style.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="https://www.instagram.com/wrapandwow5/" target="_blank">
          Customise Your Gift
        </a>
      </div>

    </section>


    <section>

      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <p>Made with attention to the little details.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="services">

        <div class="service">
          <h3>Handmade</h3>
          <p>Each piece is prepared with care rather than mass-produced.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service">
          <h3>Customisation</h3>
          <p>Choose colours, quantities and details according to your occasion.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service">
          <h3>Gift Ready</h3>
          <p>Beautifully prepared pieces made for gifting.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service">
          <h3>Delivery & Pickup</h3>
          <p>Delivery and take-away service available.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="order" id="order">

      <div class="order-box">

        <h2>Ready to Order?</h2>

        <p>
          Send us a DM with the details of the gift you have in mind.
        </p>

        <div class="steps">
          <div><strong>1.</strong> Tell us what you'd like.</div>
          <div><strong>2.</strong> Share your preferred colours and quantity.</div>
          <div><strong>3.</strong> Tell us the date you need it.</div>
          <div><strong>4.</strong> We'll confirm the price and details.</div>
        </div>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="https://www.instagram.com/wrapandwow5/"
          target="_blank"
        >
          Order on Instagram
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>


  <footer>

    <h3>Wrap and Wow 5</h3>

    <p>Handmade gifts • Wrapped with love</p>

    <p>Sialkot, Pakistan</p>

    <div class="socials">
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/wrapandwow5/" target="_blank">
        Instagram
      </a>

      <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@wrapandwow.5" target="_blank">
        TikTok
      </a>
    </div>

  </footer>

</body>
</html>
